5.1.22.4 GetClampTmpBufferFactorSize
Function Description
Obtains maxLiveNodeCnt and extraBuf to calculate the maximum number of
elements that can be calculated by an operator at a time when the space is fixed.
maxLiveNodeCnt indicates how many times the temporary space is the data
volume computed per time. extraBuf indicates the size of the extra temporary
space.
